etails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 9:30 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:11</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
